  "final": "所有关键数据已收集完毕，下面给出完整答案。\n\n---\n\n## 1. FY26 Q4 摊薄 EPS：GAAP vs Non-GAAP\n\n| 口径 | FY26 Q4 EPS | 同比增长 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **GAAP** | **$4.81** | **+32%** |\n| **Non-GAAP（调整后）** | **$4.74** | **+23%** |\n\n出处：press_release.txt 第 915 字符处明确列出：\"Diluted earnings per share was $4.81 and increased 32% on a GAAP basis, and was $4.74 and increased 23% on a non-GAAP basis\"。10k.txt 第 339649 字符处年度对照表给出同样的 FY26 全年数字（GAAP $17.95 / Non-GAAP $17.28）。\n\n---\n\n## 2. 去年同期（FY25 Q4）的摊薄 EPS\n\n| 口径 | FY25 Q4 EPS |\n|---|---|\n| **GAAP** | **$3.65** |\n| **Non-GAAP（调整后）** | **$3.86** |\n\n出处：10k.txt 第 21999 字符处的\"季度损益表\"对比表（Q4'25 列），标题为\"Diluted Earnings per Share\"——GAAP $3.65，Adjusted (non-GAAP) $3.86。同时 10k.txt 第 6838 字符处 Non-GAAP 定义段落确认：\"In fiscal year 2025, net income and diluted EPS were impacted by net losses from investments in OpenAI, which resulted in a decrease in net income and diluted EPS of $1,575 million and $0.21, respectively, in the fourth quarter\"，即 FY25 Q4 Non-GAAP = GAAP $3.65 + $0.21 = $3.86。\n\n---\n\n## 3. 同比增速差距的来源（GAAP +32% vs Non-GAAP +23%）\n\n差距约 **9 个百分点**，具体来源是 **OpenAI 投资的会计影响在两年间方向相反**。\n\n- **FY26 Q4**：GAAP 净利包含 OpenAI **净收益 $480M**（每股 +$0.07）；Non-GAAP 将其剔除。\n  出处：10k.txt 第 6838 字符：\"In fiscal year 2026, net income and diluted earnings per share were impacted by net gains from investments in OpenAI, which resulted in an increase in net income and diluted earnings per share of $480 million and $0.07, respectively, in the fourth quarter\"。\n\n- **FY25 Q4**：GAAP 净利包含 OpenAI **净亏损 $1,575M**（每股 -$0.21）；Non-GAAP 将其剔除。\n  出处：同上段落：\"In fiscal year 2025, net income and diluted earnings per share were impacted by net losses from investments in OpenAI, which resulted in a decrease in net income and diluted EPS of $1,575 million and $0.21, respectively, in the fourth quarter\"。\n\nGAAP 口径下，今年的 OpenAI 收益（+$0.07）相对于去年的 OpenAI 亏损（-$0.21）产生了 **$0.28/股的反向摆动**。这部分对 GAAP 同比增速额外贡献约 7.7 个百分点（$0.28 ÷ 去年 GAAP 基数 $3.65 ≈ 7.67pp），加上四舍五入即构成 GAAP（+32%）与 Non-GAAP（+23%）之间约 9pp 的差距。\n\n**是否反映核心经营业务的改善？**\n**不反映**。GAAP 增速比 Non-GAAP 快 9pp，全部来自 OpenAI 投资会计口径的摆动——这是非经常性的金融投资收益/损失项目，与核心云业务、AI 产品收入等经营业务无关。事实上，从 Non-GAAP 口径（+23%）更能反映核心经营改善；而 GAAP 口径被 OpenAI 收益进一步放大。若剔除 OpenAI 影响，GAAP 与 Non-GAAP 增速本应一致。\n\n---\n\n## 4. \"离散项\" vs 口径差异：是不是同一回事？\n\n**不是同一回事。**\n\n- **口径差异**（GAAP vs Non-GAAP）：源于是否剔除 OpenAI 投资净收益/亏损，是会计分类方法的差异，跨期比较时因 OpenAI 敞口方向相反而放大同比增速差距。\n  出处：10k.txt 第 6511 字符：\"Non-GAAP results exclude the impact from investments in OpenAI\"。\n\n- **离散项**（discrete items）：指本季度实际业绩与 **4 月 29 日 forward-looking guidance** 之间的偏离，是一个**与前期指引横向比较**的概念，不涉及跨年同期对比。\n  出处：press_release.txt 第 745 字符：\"Several discrete items impacted our financial results in the quarter when compared to our forward-looking guidance provided on April 29, 2026, resulting in a benefit of $0.27 on diluted earnings per share. These include a $3.2 billion gain from our investment in Anthropic and lower-than-expected expenses related to the Voluntary Retirement Program which were partially offset by severance expense and impairment charges in XBOX.\"\n\n关键区别：\n1. **比较基准不同**：口径差异是与\"去年同期\"比；离散项是与\"此前指引\"比。\n2. **金额不同**：OpenAI 敞口造成的口径差异为 $0.07/股；离散项带来的超额收益为 $0.27/股。\n3. **性质不同**：OpenAI 影响被纳入 Non-GAAP 剔除项；离散项（Anthropic 收益、VSR 成本节约、遣散费、XBOX 减值）属于 GAAP 和 Non-GAAP **共同包含**的项目，两者都不调整。\n\n简言之：离散项是\"本期实际 vs 本期指引\"的偏差；口径差异是\"今年 EPS vs 去年 EPS\"时因为 GAAP/Non-GAAP 定义不同而产生的增速差。两者是完全独立的概念。",
